.venv/

# Data. The client spreadsheet and every artefact derived from it stay out of
# git: they carry applicant information, the caches are large, and steps 00-04
# regenerate all of it. Directory structure is kept via .gitkeep.
data/raw/*
data/interim/*
data/outputs/*
!data/**/.gitkeep

